          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tab Customer, Cardholder & Account Information",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:5}\n**Tab Customer Information** menampilkan data customer yang terkait:\n• Customer Number, Category, Nationality, Resident\n\n**Tab Cardholder Information** menampilkan data pemegang kartu:\n• Cardholder Name, Surname, First Name, Second Name\n• Birthday, Place of Birth, Gender\n• ID Number, ID Issue Date, ID Expire Date\n\n**Tab Account Information** menampilkan data rekening:\n• Account Number: Nomor rekening terkait kartu\n• Account Type: Jenis rekening (SAVINGS, CURRENT, dll)\n• Account Status: Status rekening (ACTIVE, CLOSED, dll)\n• Currency: Mata uang rekening\n\n> Setiap tab memiliki scroll terpisah jika data terlalu panjang. Field yang kosong akan menampilkan \"-\".",
          "color": "#9333ea",
          "bg": "#faf5ff",
          "previewHtml": {
